# The Command Well (CIPlay the_command_well): elevation -30, the surface at h=30. The deck, the lift order, the first
# landing's air, the anglers, the dome, the crew's names, the desk, the log, ring 1, the consoles (a fresh world has no
# choice from the court: FULL refuses, STANDBY answers; inside the plan play the court pulled REACTIVATE, so FULL answers
# and STANDBY refuses - either way one console sets the rings), the closing note, back to the deck.
island The Command Well
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Heart
expect hidden lastlog
expect hidden closing_standby
zone shaft_top
expect step 1
read Lift order
expect step 2
air shaft_10
expect step 3
kill Angler fish
expect animals Angler fish 0
expect step 4
air dome
expect step 5
read Crew names
expect step 6
use commanddesk
expect shown lastlog
expect step 7
read Last crew's log
expect step 8
zone ring_1
expect step 9
use console_re
use console_standby
expect step 10
read Closing note
zone wellridge
expect step 11
read Pump house book
use fusebox
expect message three empty sockets
expect step 12
open Fuse tin
wait 3
open Cable cave chest
wait 3
open Supply plane's crate
wait 3
expect story wellfuse 3
expect step 13
use fusebox
expect story wellfuse 0
expect shown pumplocker
open Pump house locker
wait 3
expect step 15
# (deep pass 10-24: the top locker refuses, the dive, the air bell, the dive chest, the buried tins, the tower)
open Crane locker
expect message valve spindle
zone cw_dive
expect step 16
air cw_air
open Spoil boat chest
wait 3
expect story wellvalve 1
expect step 17
open Boat bilge box
wait 3
dig 1
climb 50.13 -45.7
open Crane stash
wait 3
read Spoil cairn
dig 0
zone cw_top
expect step 18
open Crane locker
wait 3
expect step 19
use cw_lock1
use cw_lock2
use cw_lock3
use cw_lock4
use cw_lock5
open Chained hatch
wait 3
expect step 20
# (no step check here: the shaft top was passed on the way down, so the last step can count at once)
zone shaft_top
expect done
